    797  f401							; TitleSequence — intro ($FD) phase machine (plans/title_bomb_sequence_plan).
    798  f401							; Cross-bank entry: bank0 TitleSequenceFold (jsr → sta $1FF8 → jmp $F4C4,
    799  f401							; the jmp bytes are mirrored in this bank); tail exits jmp $FBF8 (ReturnPad)
    800  f401							; so the bank0 jsr returns. Runs once per frame from TitleIntro. No jsr
    801  f401							; inside (fold depth must not nest). Guard: DropTarget == $FD.
    802  f401							;   0 fly right→140	1 drop→48  2 face left  3 arm bomb (fuse 180)
    803  f401							;   4 walk→76 (screen center)  5 wait explosion  6 walk→20 (home)
    804  f401							;   7 pause 240 → reset to 0 (loop)
    805  f401							; Fuse/explosion countdown is OWNED here — TitleTailAudio skips BombTick on
    806  f401							; titles, so no walls/score/lives side effects can leak into title state.
    807  f401							; BombY is never set: the band bottom-aligns the bomb to RoomY==48's sprite
    808  f401							; window (armed only while grounded), so there is no reader for it.
